[react-components.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/react-components.mdc) - Common React component rules

- React components live in `next-app/components` folder
- Use existing shadcn/ui components where possible from `next-app/components/ui`
- If more shadcn components are needed, use the command `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add component-name` (run from the `next-app` directory)
- Use Server Components by default - only mark with `'use client'` when necessary
- Server Components can be async and fetch data directly
- Client Components must be marked with `'use client'` and can use React hooks
- Import types from `@/lib/definitions` for shared data types (from `next-app/lib/definitions.ts`)

